microcom
Usage: microcom [-d DELAY_MS] [-t TIMEOUT_MS ] [-s SPEED] [-X] TTY

Copy bytes from stdin to TTY and from TTY to stdout.

	-d DELAY_MS	Wait up to DELAY_MS for TTY output before sending
			every next byte to it
	-t TIMEOUT_MS	Exit if both stdin and TTY are silent for TIMEOUT_MS
	-s SPEED	Baud rate, e.g. 115200
	-X		Disable special meaning of NUL and Ctrl-X from stdin
